{"id":"1ba1e97f4525d4ac","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-inequality.md","title":"Inequality","display":"df-inequality — Inequality","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-inequality","aliases":["58-df-inequality"],"display":"df-inequality — Inequality","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-inequality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-inequality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inequality — Inequality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\leq,&lt;\\in V\">\\(A,\\leq,&lt;\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictPart}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{StrictPart}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inequality} \\vdash \\mathrm{StrictPart}_S(&lt;,\\leq,A)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq,A)\\land &lt;\\;=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\times A\\mid \\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq\\;\\land x\\neq y\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inequality} \\vdash \\mathrm{StrictPart}_S(&lt;,\\leq,A)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq,A)\\land &lt;\\;=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\times A\\mid \\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq\\;\\land x\\neq y\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom records strict inequality from a non-strict order.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\leq,<\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrictPart}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inequality} \\vdash \\mathrm{StrictPart}_S(<,\\leq,A)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq,A)\\land <\\;=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\times A\\mid \\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\leq\\;\\land x\\neq y\\}","display":true}],"bytes":720,"backlinks":[{"id":"e825d53bd327fe88","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-677","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-inequality.md|58-df-inequality]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["2aa29158e60b337f"]}